# Translation draft; review by a native speaker.
lens_profiles.invalid = Khetha uvimba weenkcukacha osebenzayo we-Lensfun v1/v2 XML (ukuya kwi-8 MiB) onedatha yekhamera okanye yelensi exhaswayo.
lens_profiles.calibration = Ulungelelwaniso lwelensi
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Akukho datha yolungelelwaniso ehambelana nolu seto. Jonga ubude befokhasi kunye nomlinganiselo wokusika wekhamera; ukulungisa ngesandla kusafumaneka.
lens_profiles.import = Ngenisa i-Lensfun XML…
lens_profiles.imported = Uvimba weenkcukacha we-Lensfun ungeniselwe le seshoni. Khetha iprofayili yelensi okanye uthelekise iinkcukacha zesithombe.
lens_profiles.manual = Ukulungisa ngesandla kuphela
lens_profiles.saved = Ulungelelwaniso olugciniweyo (uvimba weenkcukacha awufumaneki)
lens_profiles.profile = Iprofayili yelensi
lens_profiles.aperture = Ukuvuleka kwelensi (0 = akwaziwa)
lens_profiles.distance = Umgama wokugxila (0 = akwaziwa)
lens_profiles.vignette = Ukulungiswa kobumnyama emacaleni ngokolungelelwaniso
lens_profiles.color_context = Ukulungiswa kobumnyama emacaleni ngokolungelelwaniso kufuna iprofayili ye-sRGB eyakhelwe ngaphakathi. Guqulela umfanekiso kwi-sRGB ukuze ugcine inkangeleko yawo, emva koko uvule kwakhona “Ukulungisa Ilensi”. Ukuba iipikseli sele ziyi-sRGB kodwa zingenaleyibhile, kwanele ukwabela iprofayili ye-sRGB. Ukulungiswa kwemilo nokuphambuka kwemibala kusafumaneka.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Akukho lungiselelo lobumnyama emacaleni oluhambelana noku kuvuleka kwelensi nomgama wokugxila. Faka amaxabiso alinganisiweyo ukuze ulusebenzise; kwiiprofayili ezininzi ze-Lensfun, i-1000 m imele ukugxila kude.
lens_profiles.note = Ukulungisa ngokolungelelwaniso kwenziwa ngaphambi kwezilawuli zesandla. Sebenzisa isakhelo sokuqala esipheleleyo; usike kamva. Gcina uluhlu lwezihluzi kwi-PSD/PSB ukuze ulungelelwaniso luhlale luhleleka.
lens_profiles.automatic = Thelekisa iinkcukacha zesithombe
lens_profiles.components = Ukusebenza kweprofayili: ukugqwetheka {distortion}; imiphetho enemibala {tca}; ubumnyama emacaleni {vignette}.
